#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:4
msgid "v5.0.0"
msgstr "v5.0.0"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v5.0.0 is the first OpenMV Viewer release. OpenMV Viewer is a separate, "
"read-only build of OpenMV IDE for showing off a finished product built on an"
" OpenMV Cam: it streams the camera's live output and runs a script, but the "
"development tools are removed, so a customer or an end user can see what a "
"product does without the full development environment. It installs and runs "
"independently of OpenMV IDE."
msgstr ""
"v5.0.0 adalah rilis OpenMV Viewer yang pertama. OpenMV Viewer adalah build "
"OpenMV IDE yang terpisah dan hanya-baca untuk memamerkan produk selesai yang"
" dibangun di atas OpenMV Cam: ia menstreaming keluaran langsung kamera dan "
"menjalankan sebuah skrip, tetapi alat pengembangannya dihapus, sehingga "
"seorang pelanggan atau pengguna akhir dapat melihat apa yang dilakukan "
"sebuah produk tanpa lingkungan pengembangan yang lengkap. Ia dipasang dan "
"berjalan secara independen dari OpenMV IDE."

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:16
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Pada halaman ini"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:19
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Sorotan"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:21
msgid ""
"**A read-only telemetry viewer** — the frame buffer, serial terminal, and "
"histogram work exactly as they do in OpenMV IDE, so you can watch what the "
"camera captures and what its script prints live."
msgstr ""
"**Penampil telemetri hanya-baca** — frame buffer, terminal serial, dan "
"histogram bekerja persis seperti di OpenMV IDE, sehingga Anda dapat melihat "
"apa yang ditangkap kamera dan apa yang dicetak skripnya secara langsung."

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Runs a product's script** — Run and Stop work and run a script from disk, "
"and the running script can be stopped when the viewer connects or "
"disconnects, so a device is always in a known state."
msgstr ""
"**Menjalankan skrip sebuah produk** — Run dan Stop bekerja dan menjalankan "
"skrip dari disk, dan skrip yang berjalan dapat dihentikan saat viewer "
"terhubung atau terputus, sehingga sebuah perangkat selalu berada dalam "
"keadaan yang diketahui."

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Authoring tools removed** — the editor's development features, the machine"
" vision authoring tools, the AI and model tools, and the developer settings "
"are all stripped out, leaving a focused viewing application."
msgstr ""
"**Alat penulisan dihapus** — fitur pengembangan editor, alat penulisan "
"machine vision, alat AI dan model, serta pengaturan pengembang semuanya "
"dihilangkan, menyisakan aplikasi penampilan yang terfokus."

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Installs on its own** — the viewer is branded and installed as *OpenMV "
"Viewer*, with its own application name, settings, and identity, so it "
"coexists with a full OpenMV IDE installation."
msgstr ""
"**Terpasang sendiri** — viewer diberi merek dan dipasang sebagai *OpenMV "
"Viewer*, dengan nama aplikasi, pengaturan, dan identitasnya sendiri, "
"sehingga berdampingan dengan instalasi OpenMV IDE yang lengkap."

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:35
msgid "What's included"
msgstr "Yang disertakan"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Live camera output** — the frame buffer viewer, the serial terminal, and "
"the histogram, with the same controls as OpenMV IDE."
msgstr ""
"**Keluaran kamera langsung** — penampil frame buffer, terminal serial, dan "
"histogram, dengan kontrol yang sama seperti OpenMV IDE."

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Run / Stop and stop-on-connect** — run the product's script from disk, and"
" halt it when the viewer attaches or detaches."
msgstr ""
"**Run / Stop dan stop-on-connect** — jalankan skrip produk dari disk, dan "
"hentikan saat viewer terhubung atau terlepas."

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:41
msgid ""
"**File and Edit menus and Preferences** — kept so the viewer stays usable "
"(open a file, adjust the interface), while the developer-only categories are"
" hidden."
msgstr ""
"**Menu File dan Edit serta Preferences** — dipertahankan agar viewer tetap "
"dapat digunakan (membuka file, menyesuaikan antarmuka), sementara kategori "
"khusus pengembang disembunyikan."

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:44
msgid ""
"**Firmware update and recovery** — the firmware manager, bootloader "
"recovery, and loading a ROM file system onto the camera are kept, so the "
"viewer can still recover or re-provision a device in the field."
msgstr ""
"**Pembaruan dan pemulihan firmware** — pengelola firmware, pemulihan "
"bootloader, dan pemuatan sistem file ROM ke kamera dipertahankan, sehingga "
"viewer masih dapat memulihkan atau menyediakan ulang sebuah perangkat di "
"lapangan."

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Fiducial generators** — the AprilTag, DataMatrix, QR, and barcode "
"generators are kept, since they are useful outside development too."
msgstr ""
"**Generator fidusial** — generator AprilTag, DataMatrix, QR, dan barcode "
"dipertahankan, karena berguna di luar pengembangan juga."

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:51
msgid "What's removed"
msgstr "Yang dihapus"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:53
msgid ""
"The script-authoring editor features, the machine vision tuning tools "
"(threshold editor, keypoints editor, and the like), the AI and model-"
"training tools, the model zoo and dataset editor, and the developer settings"
" categories. Firmware-upgrade and onboarding prompts are suppressed so a "
"demo never interrupts to change the device."
msgstr ""
"Fitur editor penulisan skrip, alat penyetelan machine vision (editor ambang,"
" editor keypoint, dan sejenisnya), alat AI dan pelatihan model, model zoo "
"dan editor dataset, serta kategori pengaturan pengembang. Peringatan "
"pembaruan firmware dan onboarding ditekan sehingga sebuah demo tidak pernah "
"menyela untuk mengubah perangkat."

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:60
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "Dukungan platform dan alat"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:62
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 14.0.2 (shared with OpenMV IDE)."
msgstr "**Basis Qt Creator:** 14.0.2 (dibagikan dengan OpenMV IDE)."

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:63
msgid ""
"**Availability:** Windows, macOS, and Linux, installed separately from "
"OpenMV IDE."
msgstr ""
"**Ketersediaan:** Windows, macOS, dan Linux, dipasang terpisah dari OpenMV "
"IDE."

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:67
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "Perubahan yang tidak kompatibel"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.0.0.rst:69
msgid "None — this is the first release."
msgstr "Tidak ada — ini adalah rilis pertama."
